{"parse": {"title": "秘闻之声", "pageid": 25350, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"item-infobox\"><div style=\"position:absolute; width:100%; height:100%; overflow:hidden;\"><div class=\"glow-top\"><div></div></div><div class=\"glow-bottom\"><div></div></div></div><div class=\"item-infobox-box\"><div class=\"item-infobox-image\"><img alt=\"秘闻之声\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/8/8d/Item-140010.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"秘闻之声\" width=\"256\" height=\"256\" class=\"img-fit mid-position\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></div><div class=\"item-infobox-content\"><div class=\"serif\" style=\"font-size:22px\"><b>秘闻之声</b><img alt=\"CurrencyIcon-140010 1.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/95/CurrencyIcon-140010_1.png/24px-CurrencyIcon-140010_1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/95/CurrencyIcon-140010_1.png/36px-CurrencyIcon-140010_1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/95/CurrencyIcon-140010_1.png/48px-CurrencyIcon-140010_1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"54\" data-file-height=\"54\" /><div class=\"hide-m test-hide grey-small\" style=\"float:right; font-family:sans-serif; font-size:16px\"><span class=\"no-select\">编号ID：</span>1#140010</div></div><hr /><div>一段陌生而熟悉的声音，可用于在银行内[秘闻鉴定]处的兑换。</div><div style=\"color:#696969\">那些特立独行、难以捕捉的声音，新朋友，或者更古怪的孩子。它们包含许多：模糊的喃喃自语，一段哼唱，一些关于天体、幸运卡片或晚餐食材的讨论。它们行色匆匆，更加难以解读，也更加——更加具有诱惑力。</div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "物品"}], "displaytitle": "秘闻之声"}}